{"exhaustive":{"nbHits":true,"typo":true},"exhaustiveNbHits":true,"exhaustiveTypo":true,"hits":[{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"jacquesm"},"title":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["nvidia"],"value":"Flare, <em>Nvidia</em>'s DGX Spark Inference Engine"},"url":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["nvidia"],"value":"https://github.com/<em>NVIDIA</em>/spark-local-inference"}},"_tags":["story","author_jacquesm","story_50331803"],"author":"jacquesm","children":[50332246],"created_at":"2026-11-02T01:11:27Z","created_at_i":1793581887,"num_comments":1,"objectID":"50331803","points":1,"story_id":50331803,"title":"Flare, Nvidia's DGX Spark Inference Engine","updated_at":"2026-11-02T02:16:11Z","url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/spark-local-inference"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"andsoitis"},"title":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["nvidia"],"value":"A History of <em>Nvidia</em> Stream Multiprocessor (2020)"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://fabiensanglard.net/cuda/index.html"}},"_tags":["story","author_andsoitis","story_50330520"],"author":"andsoitis","created_at":"2026-11-01T22:18:25Z","created_at_i":1793571505,"num_comments":0,"objectID":"50330520","points":2,"story_id":50330520,"title":"A History of Nvidia Stream Multiprocessor (2020)","updated_at":"2026-11-01T23:15:40Z","url":"https://fabiensanglard.net/cuda/index.html"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"mdp2021"},"title":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["nvidia"],"value":"<em>Nvidia</em> Didn't Want Me to Do This: Linux on RTX Spark [video]"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0N3TksVcH7Y"}},"_tags":["story","author_mdp2021","story_50325088"],"author":"mdp2021","created_at":"2026-11-01T12:41:36Z","created_at_i":1793536896,"num_comments":0,"objectID":"50325088","points":2,"story_id":50325088,"title":"Nvidia Didn't Want Me to Do This: Linux on RTX Spark [video]","updated_at":"2026-11-01T23:24:25Z","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0N3TksVcH7Y"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"BrandoDev_it"},"story_text":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["nvidia"],"value":"Hi, take a look at this.\nI didn't like KDE nor KDE Themes, so I made Vela, a new stacking desktop environment, and even though this is not very inspired in terms of aesthetic, this is not the point of Vela (not yet).\nPoint of Vela is mostly architecture: Vulkan 1.4 only, no OpenGL fallback; based on wlroots, but has a custom renderer.\nGPL3 license.\nVela is currently at 0.1.0 beta after one month of Alpha testing. Tested and working both on AMD and <em>Nvidia</em>.\nRequirements: a GPU and driver with Vulkan 1.4 support.\nI\u2019m looking for people to try it on their hardware and report issues, and for contributors. Thanks<p>code: <a href=\"https://github.com/vela-desktop/vela\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/vela-desktop/vela</a>"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Show HN: Vela, a New Linux Desktop Environment"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://velade.org/blog/vela-0-1/"}},"_tags":["story","author_BrandoDev_it","story_50321663","show_hn"],"author":"BrandoDev_it","children":[50323365,50323471,50323218,50323197,50323544],"created_at":"2026-11-01T00:36:10Z","created_at_i":1793493370,"num_comments":14,"objectID":"50321663","points":12,"story_id":50321663,"story_text":"Hi, take a look at this.\nI didn&#x27;t like KDE nor KDE Themes, so I made Vela, a new stacking desktop environment, and even though this is not very inspired in terms of aesthetic, this is not the point of Vela (not yet).\nPoint of Vela is mostly architecture: Vulkan 1.4 only, no OpenGL fallback; based on wlroots, but has a custom renderer.\nGPL3 license.\nVela is currently at 0.1.0 beta after one month of Alpha testing. Tested and working both on AMD and Nvidia.\nRequirements: a GPU and driver with Vulkan 1.4 support.\nI\u2019m looking for people to try it on their hardware and report issues, and for contributors. Thanks<p>code: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;vela-desktop&#x2F;vela\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;vela-desktop&#x2F;vela</a>","title":"Show HN: Vela, a New Linux Desktop Environment","updated_at":"2026-11-01T20:14:40Z","url":"https://velade.org/blog/vela-0-1/"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"g58892881"},"title":{"fullyHighlighted":false,"matchLevel":"full","matchedWords":["nvidia"],"value":"Show HN: <em>Nvidia</em> RE-USE speech enhancement model running in the browser on WebGPU"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://re-use-demo.geronimo-labs.com"}},"_tags":["story","author_g58892881","story_50320492","show_hn"],"author":"g58892881","created_at":"2026-10-31T21:38:20Z","created_at_i":1793482700,"num_comments":0,"objectID":"50320492","points":2,"story_id":50320492,"title":"Show HN: Nvidia RE-USE speech enhancement model running in the browser on WebGPU","updated_at":"2026-10-31T21:48:21Z","url":"https://re-use-demo.geronimo-labs.com"}],"hitsPerPage":5,"nbHits":185,"nbPages":37,"page":0,"params":"query=NVIDIA&tags=story&numericFilters=created_at_i%3E1790994428%2Ccreated_at_i%3C1793586428&hitsPerPage=5&advancedSyntax=true&analyticsTags=backend","processingTimeMS":3,"processingTimingsMS":{"_request":{"queue":1,"roundTrip":23},"fetch":{"query":1,"total":2},"total":3},"query":"NVIDIA","serverTimeMS":4}
